# Line endings are a property of this project, not of whoever checks it out.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, so without this file the
# same commit would produce different bytes on different machines - and the
# frontend sources here are served to the WebView verbatim, so different
# bytes means a different application.
#
# The default is binary and the text kinds opt back in by extension. That
# direction is deliberate: the next file somebody adds inherits nothing, and
# an image or a font declared as text would be corrupted on checkout.

* -text

*.md            text eol=lf
*.txt           text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.js            text eol=lf
*.mjs           text eol=lf
*.ts            text eol=lf
*.tsx           text eol=lf
*.css           text eol=lf
*.html          text eol=lf
*.svg           text eol=lf
*.lpr           text eol=lf
*.lpi           text eol=lf
*.pas           text eol=lf
*.inc           text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
.gitignore      text eol=lf
.gitattributes  text eol=lf
